window.products.push({"id":400006,"name":"Aitliving Pack of 2 Full Sequin Decorative Pillow Cover 12X20 Matte Antique Gold Matte Atlantis Mermaid 2-Tone Reversible Sequins Glitter Throw Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PpjCOUwUL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Customers Review Comments: The flip sequins is beautiful and created the simple pop, made from a very soft material so the backside is comfortable to lay on. Vibrant colors, beautiful well made. Shiny, pretty, fairly elegant. Cute and classy pillow case, a fun pillow, not cheap looking. Perfect holiday pillow! Muy bonito , facil de limpiar It puts lovely a touch my to couch.  Aitliving Designed Home Decor Throw Pillow Covers, Toss Pillow Covers, Accent Decorative Pillowcases, Sofa, Bed, Floor, Couch, Loveseat Pillow Cushion Covers. DIY Flipped Glitter Sequins Mermaid Pillow Cover Pillow Shell ONLY Two-color shimmer sequins reversible pillow case, mermaid style Matte Atlantis and Matte Antique Gold sequins pillow cover throw cushion case for couch, home decorating Thanks Giving Christmas winter new year family party decoration white Christmas pillow cover decorative sequins festive cushion pillow cover full sequins embroidered pillow cover magic gift.  Shimmer breakfast cushion pillow is alluring, on-trend, interactive design with two-toned sequins; one matte antique gold color, one matte atlantis dark blue color.The cushions not only look fabulous, but they are quality made in the seasons latest colors. The sequins change color as swipe your hand across the surface, so addictive to touch, it's hard to put them down! Reversible Glitter Sequins Pillow Cushion Cover Full Embroidery Flipped Shimmer Pillow Cover ONLY.  The pillows' reversible sequins, one side which is atlantis blue and another side which is antique gold colour, they can be flipped from the antique to atlantis color so you can add as much sparkle as you'd like.  No inserts included, and any insert between 30X50cm and 35X55cm will fit.  Size: 12 X 20 inch, 30 X 50 cm (1-2cm measurement error )  Each Piece Net Weight about 170g. Bottom side has an invisible zipper closure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PpjCOUwUL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aitliving","source_asin":"B088GRFP6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-400006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088GRFP6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088GRFP6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
