window.products.push({"id":400022,"name":"Sunflower Gurgle Pot - Set of 2, French Inspired Design, Large Pitcher 42 oz. with matching Creamer, the perfect Indoor or outdoor tableware.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HVejCe1nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You can use the durable, sturdy, functional Gurgle Pot in various ways: Motivate kids to drink more water or use it as an amusing flower vase. Let your creativity flow, the gurglepot be used as a designer flower vase or use it on the beach table when serving a seafood meal. How the Gurgle Pot works The actual \"gurgle\" sound happens after you pour and when you tilt the GurglePot back upward. But it needs to have water left in it to work. To get an idea of how it works fill it a little more than half full, about up to the gill. Then pretend to pour, but just before it come out bring the pot back upright. Now you can see the air bubbles create the sound.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HVejCe1nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gurgle Pot","source_asin":"B0916J9KT4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-400022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0916J9KT4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0916J9KT4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
