window.products.push({"id":400048,"name":"Kilner Square Swing Top Glass Jar | 1L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bk04XevFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Kilner Clip Top Jar is ideal for preserving healthy, homegrown foods. The contemporary square jar shape is space saving making it ideal for pantry storage. Each jar embodies the traditional Kilner styling with the authentic embossed logo and contains a detailed instruction leaflet inside. With a capacity of 1 Litre / 1000 ml this jar is the ideal size for pickling large vegetables, preserving whole fruits and storing dry foods like flour, pasta and lentils. Featuring a high-grade stainless steel clip system, engineered to create the ideal tension providing an airtight and secure seal. Robust and durable for everyday use, each jar is made from high-quality sodalime glass with pristine clarity and consistent wall thickness ensuring no weak points. This Jar is suitable for use in the dishwasher. Please do not pour boiling water directly into the jar. This glass jar is ideal for storing / preserving and transporting food and drink. It is made from natural ingredients so no harmful chemicals or toxins can leak into the food. Glass is BPA free and does not absorb odours, flavours or stains. Not only is glass a healthier option, it is made to last and never for single use. Kilner continues to tackle plastic waste with our ethos of REUSE, REFILL, RECYCLE. The original Kilner Jar, invented by John Kilner and Co. in England is as much loved and successful now as it was over 180 years ago.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bk04XevFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kilner","source_asin":"B09R8YXFN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-400048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R8YXFN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R8YXFN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
