window.products.push({"id":400100,"name":"Kurrajong Farmhouse Wax Melt Warmer | Tea Light Wax Warmer for Scented Wax | Wax Burner | Soy Wax Melts Warmer with Ceramic Bowl | Essential Oil Burne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qkWDCIpML._AC_SL1397_.jpg","description":"ADD STYLE and scent to your room at the same time - This lovely tea light melter for scented wax, or for aromatherapy oils, will stand out as a lovely decor piece. THICKER FRAME - we have made the frame stronger and the matt ceramic bowl is larger ESSENTIAL OILS OR SCENTED WAX - Either use will refresh your home instantly - for essential oils....fill the bowl with water and add a few drops of essential oil. If using to melt wax cubes, add two - four cubes at a time and replenish with more wax cubes as needed. Also known as a melter for fragrant wax tarts, wax melter, or wax cube melter. PORTABLE - Add ambiance easily - with the beauty of a tea light candle melts burner and the convenience of being able to move it around the house, diffusing a delicate aroma throughout your home is so doable. LOVELY GIFT - great housewarming present or a lovely gift for moms SUITS ANY SPACE OR DECOR - home or office, spa, salon, meditation room or yoga studio. A nice alternative to an electric wax warmer or plug in wax warmer PERFECT SIZE - and perfect height between the bowl and your tea light candle - so that the bowl doesn't go black underneath from the candle. We note other brands have a small distance between bowl and tea light and their bowls may blacken quickly. Please note we recommend a 4 or 9 hr tea light candle, not the small 2 hr ones that have a tiny wick and take too long to warm the wax. HAPPINESS GUARANTEED - If you're not completely delighted with your scented oil burner please let us know and we will refund it. THANK YOU for visiting our Kurrajong Farmhouse store - We hope you come back again soon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qkWDCIpML._AC_SL1397_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kurrajong Farmhouse","source_asin":"B07RQX5992","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-400100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQX5992","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQX5992","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
