window.products.push({"id":400579,"name":"Famard Initial Embroidery Canvas Tote Bag with Zipper and Inner Pocket, Personalized Birthday/Bride to Be Gifts for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615VzGPa6ZL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Famard canvas tote bag is a good size for the beach or for the office or on the go. It is very nice for any special occasion,it will make a wonderful birthday, Christmas, mother's day, wedding shower or just a thank you gift. Elegant embroidery design Initial is fully stitched and not just pasted on, and it was personalized which added to the charm.Having the initial embroidery on the canvas tote bag makes it feel like one of those expensive tote bags. Top zipper closure for privacy Our personalized large tote bags for women has a zipper added on the top, which increases personal privacy protection . Inner pockets for small items The little zipper pocket inside is perfect for small things you want to be able to access quickly like lip gloss or your phone, keeps small items from getting lost. Waterproof lining and reusable Our beach bags for women are made of durable and heavy canvas, the interior is waterproof lined.Due to the water-resistant lining, you can store wet towels, gym clothes, and swimsuits with no worries. Our reusable personalized canvas bag is easily hand-washable and long-lasting(Note:machine wash not recommended), it will serve endless purpose year round and help you to reduce the plastic bag use! Multi purpose , perfect for gifting The womens gifts tote bag is versatile, it can be used as work bags for women, wedding gift bag, beach tote bag, teacher gift ,grocery shopping bag ,travel tote and more. The embroidery monogram makes it a wonderful gift for teachers, friends, brides, etc, Used this canvas tote as a gift bag, it really made the gift stand out with the monogram letter on it. Perfect for work, great for gifting! This personalized initial canvas tote bag as a great gift idea or just to have for yourself.Add to the cart now！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615VzGPa6ZL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Famard","source_asin":"B0B24SZ975","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-400579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B24SZ975","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B24SZ975","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
