window.products.push({"id":400608,"name":"Sprinkled Flowers by Silvia Vassileva, 16x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LDykqdrNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a patch of red flowers stretching across the scene. Silvia Vassileva pursued her love of art at the Academy of fine art in Bulgaria, where she earned both her bachelors and masters degrees. She spent six years painting and exhibiting her work in Japan before moving to the U.S. Silvia describes her style as very free and bold. She makes her paintings come alive by using contrast and unusual color palettes. Silvia's home studio, which she designed herself, is bright, contemporary and minimalist. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LDykqdrNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B076V9PC1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-400608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076V9PC1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076V9PC1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
