window.products.push({"id":400766,"name":"Commercial Vegetable Dicer Stainless Steel Easy Chopper Dicer with 3/8\" Blade Vegetable Fruit Cutting Machine Kitchen Tools Food Processors for Onion ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S-ut0G6vL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"1/4\" 3/8\" Vegetable and Fruit Dicer Commercial Restaurant Introduction: Because every 3/8 inch blade intersects, this dicer always creates a uniform mold for the device. Dozens of products can be quickly cut and stored immediately for later use. Don't waste precious time cutting fruits and vegetables manually. The cutting machine uses sharp stainless steel blades, which can cut cleanly, accurately, quickly and smoothly. Just press the push block and you will see the product smoothly transform into 3/8 inch parts. In addition, because it is made of stainless steel , it has excellent corrosion resistance, and you don't have to worry about the blade coming into contact with acidic substances such as tomato juice. specification: Color: silver Cutting grid: 3/8\" (1 cm) Product weight: 2.6 kg (5.7 lbs) Material: aluminum alloy + stainless steel Product dimensions (L*W*H): 47.5 x 21 x 21 cm (18.7\" x 8.1\" x 8.1\") feature: *Vegetables diced, such as salads, pasta and soups. *Product cut into uniform 3/8\" * 3/8\" square cutting area, compact design, compatible with medium-sized fruits and vegetables *Durable aluminum casting structure ensures equipment durability *Precision stainless steel blade will not corrode *Durable aluminum casting structure ensures equipment durability *This machine has been tested and can cut celery, cucumber, bell pepper, mushroom, onion and tomato continuously. *It is recommended not to cut sweet potatoes. Sweet potatoes are very hard and will seriously damage the blade! Package Contents: 1 x Fruit and vegetable dicing machine","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S-ut0G6vL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N/B","source_asin":"B08CDRSP2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-400766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CDRSP2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CDRSP2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
