window.products.push({"id":400768,"name":"THOMAS PAYNE RV Euro Recliner with Footrest - Vinyl, Norlina","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":468.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910tUgGLl1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relax after a long day on the road in the comfortable and compact Thomas Payne® Euro Recliner by Lippert. Blending style, comfort, and functional engineering, this chair is a sleek addition to any travel trailer, 5th wheel, or motorhome, and it comes complete with a 360-degree swivel, footrest, and easy-to-operate, manual recline that extends to 59”, padded headrests and armrests, and a contouring backrest. A perfect spot for reading, relaxing, or mapping out your next big adventure, our Euro Chair is a must-have interior upgrade for your camper.Our Thomas Payne Furniture Collection comes complete with the style and color options you need to update or replace the furniture in your RV, the way you want. Our easy-to-clean, PolyHyde® vinyl fabric comes in three color options (Millbrae, Altoona, and Grummond), and this material is backed by an industry-first 5-year Hydrolysis Warranty. Norlina is our woven-fabric color option and is a durable solution for RV owners traveling with pets or little ones.And don’t forget, all of our PolyHyde vinyl fabrics can be easily cleaned with our new Thomas Payne Vinyl Fabric Cleaner, specifically formulated for safe use on your Thomas Payne furniture. Spray, wipe, and be on your way.The lightweight, versatile construction of our furniture offers seamless installation into your RV. Whether you’re upgrading old, worn furniture, or could simply use a style enhancement, Thomas Payne camper furniture helps you customize your interior to meet your exact needs.Whether you’re on the road or on the water, Lippert supplies a broad array of premium RV, towing, and marine products designed to enhance all of your recreational pursuits. Our team is committed to always thinking about your next journey — pushing the possibilities of our products and services, all to better your time spent outdoors, whenever, wherever, for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910tUgGLl1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THOMAS PAYNE","source_asin":"B092LBDSMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-400768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092LBDSMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092LBDSMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
